# Fixture for `just diagnostic-stream-smoke`: a callee that resolves to nothing.
#
# `sprout_dss_undefined` is deliberately neither a runtime builtin nor a compiler
# intrinsic. That distinction is the whole point — `int_to_string` and `print`
# ARE resolvable importlessly (ir_header emits their declares unconditionally),
# which is why the old loud-fail-smoke probe could never fail.
#
# Expected: `ERROR: check: Unknown variable` on stderr, nonzero exit, no IR.
fn main() -> Unit !{IO} =
  print(int_to_string(sprout_dss_undefined(5)))
